---
name: commit-msg
description: Write a Conventional Commit message from a short change summary. Use for "write a commit message". Do NOT use for PR descriptions.
---

# commit-msg

1. Read the change summary.
2. Pick the type: feat, fix, docs, refactor, test, or chore.
3. Write one subject line of at most 72 characters: `type(scope): summary`.
4. Return only the message.
